<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank prices 1.5 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank prices 1.5 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers HSBC Trinkaus and Commerzbank, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    04.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.925    PAY DATE  L-06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.925    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    **	  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE     SALE LIMITS US/UK/SI/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    32.5 BP   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PERCENT JULY 2007 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	   ** DUES/FFT/HK/SING</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
